@startuml scenario-b-edit-deployment
title Scenario C — Technical stakeholder edits a deployment (UC9)

actor "Technical\nstakeholder" as T
participant "Dashboard" as UI
participant "API" as API
database "Storage" as Store

T -> UI : Opens a deployment
UI -> API : Request deployment\nand connected hubs
API -> Store : Fetch records
Store --> API : Deployment + hubs
API --> UI : Deployment data
UI --> T : Pre-filled edit form

T -> UI : Updates name, dates,\nimage or hubs
T -> UI : Clicks "Save"

UI -> API : Save changes
API -> Store : Update records
Store --> API : Confirmation
API --> UI : Confirmation
UI --> T : Updated deployment shown

note over T
  Changes are now visible
  to all dashboard users
end note

@enduml
